1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,337
Bugungi videomiz qayer haqida? — Toyosu baliq bozori haqida.

2
00:00:07,337 --> 00:00:08,837
Sahna 1: Toyosu bozorini tanishtirish

3
00:00:08,837 --> 00:00:12,845
Bu yer Toyosu bozori.

4
00:00:12,868 --> 00:00:15,549
Juda katta ekan!

5
00:00:15,573 --> 00:00:20,940
Ha. Yangi va toza bozor.

6
00:00:20,963 --> 00:00:24,412
Tsukiji bozoridan ham kattaroqmi?

7
00:00:24,435 --> 00:00:28,040
Ha. Juda keng.

8
00:00:28,064 --> 00:00:31,064
Odamlar koʻp ekan-ku!

9
00:00:31,087 --> 00:00:34,579
Chet ellik sayyohlar ham koʻp.

10
00:00:34,603 --> 00:00:38,769
Har kuni soat nechada ochiladi?

11
00:00:38,792 --> 00:00:41,792
Ertalabdan boshlab ochiq boʻladi.

12
00:00:41,815 --> 00:00:44,656
Metro bekat qayerda?

13
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:47,913
Bekat shu yerda.

14
00:00:47,936 --> 00:00:50,203
Juda qulay ekan!

15
00:00:50,226 --> 00:00:54,039
Ha. Yomgʻirli kunlarda ham muammo yoʻq.

16
00:00:54,063 --> 00:00:57,129
Tez ichkariga kiramiz.

17
00:00:57,152 --> 00:00:59,921
Ha. Ketdik!

18
00:00:59,945 --> 00:01:03,220
Baliq hidi kelayapti-ku!

19
00:01:03,244 --> 00:01:07,019
Chunki yangi baliqlar koʻp.

20
00:01:07,042 --> 00:01:10,609
Och qoldim men.

21
00:01:10,632 --> 00:01:13,873
Bu yerda koʻp restoranlar bor.

22
00:01:13,897 --> 00:01:16,670
Nima yeyishimiz mumkin?

23
00:01:16,693 --> 00:01:19,711
Mazali ovqatlar koʻp.

24
00:01:19,734 --> 00:01:22,201
Qaysi joy yaxshi?

25
00:01:22,224 --> 00:01:25,108
Birga izlaymiz.

26
00:01:25,131 --> 00:01:27,990
Ana u yerda xarita bor.

27
00:01:28,014 --> 00:01:30,055
Qaraylik.

28
00:01:30,079 --> 00:01:33,480
Restoranlar yuqori qavatda ekan.

29
00:01:33,503 --> 00:01:35,936
Lift bor.

30
00:01:35,959 --> 00:01:38,359
Unga chiqamiz.

31
00:01:38,382 --> 00:01:40,719
Juda qiziq ekan!

32
00:01:40,743 --> 00:01:43,950
Ha. Tezroq boring.

33
00:01:43,973 --> 00:01:52,982
Bugungi videoning skriptini tavsif va eng yaxshi kommentariyadan yuklab olishingiz mumkin. Yuklashdan oldin izoh qoldirishni unutmang!

34
00:01:52,982 --> 00:01:54,482
Sahna 2: Mashhur sushi restoranida navbat kutish

35
00:01:54,482 --> 00:01:57,616
Bu restoran qanday?

36
00:01:57,639 --> 00:02:01,672
Odamlar koʻp navbatda turibdi-ku!

37
00:02:01,695 --> 00:02:04,628
Bu yer Sushi Dai.

38
00:02:04,651 --> 00:02:06,823
Sushi Dai debmi?

39
00:02:06,847 --> 00:02:08,380
Ha.

40
00:02:08,403 --> 00:02:11,338
Juda mashhur restoran.

41
00:02:11,361 --> 00:02:14,495
Eng mashhuri shu yerda-mi?

42
00:02:14,518 --> 00:02:15,931
Ha.

43
00:02:15,954 --> 00:02:18,721
Har doim navbat boʻladi.

44
00:02:18,744 --> 00:02:21,912
Biroz kutamizmi?

45
00:02:21,935 --> 00:02:23,102
Ha.

46
00:02:23,125 --> 00:02:24,892
Navbatga turamiz.

47
00:02:24,915 --> 00:02:27,883
Tashqarida menyu bor.

48
00:02:27,906 --> 00:02:30,152
Nima buyurtma qilamiz?

49
00:02:30,176 --> 00:02:33,309
Men tuna baliqni yaxshi koʻraman.

50
00:02:33,332 --> 00:02:35,819
Yaxshi tanlov!

51
00:02:35,842 --> 00:02:38,776
Set menyu ham bor.

52
00:02:38,799 --> 00:02:42,015
Har xil baliqlar bor ekan!

53
00:02:42,038 --> 00:02:44,805
Nima ichmoqchisiz?

54
00:02:44,829 --> 00:02:47,767
Iltimli choy, iltimos.

55
00:02:47,790 --> 00:02:50,403
Men ham xuddi shunday.

56
00:02:50,427 --> 00:02:53,994
Navbat endi bizniki.

57
00:02:54,017 --> 00:02:57,217
Doʻkonda juda toza ekan, shunday emasmi?

58
00:02:57,240 --> 00:03:00,019
Usta koʻrinib turibdi.

59
00:03:00,042 --> 00:03:02,976
Juda zoʻr koʻrinadi!

60
00:03:02,999 --> 00:03:05,765
Sushi keldi!

61
00:03:05,788 --> 00:03:08,476
Vaa, qanday chiroyli!

62
00:03:08,500 --> 00:03:10,367
Yeyishni boshlaymiz.

63
00:03:10,390 --> 00:03:13,928
Juda mazali ekan!

64
00:03:13,951 --> 00:03:16,518
Baliq shirin ekan-ku!

65
00:03:16,541 --> 00:03:18,436
Rostdan ham!

66
00:03:18,459 --> 00:03:21,547
Juda toʻydim.

67
00:03:21,570 --> 00:03:28,675
Bugungi videodagi materiallarni takrorlash uchun sayt havolasini tavsif va eng yuqori kommentariyda topishingiz mumkin. *Sayt oldindan ogohlantirmasdan oʻchirilishi mumkin.

68
00:03:28,675 --> 00:03:30,175
3-SAHNA: Dengiz mahsulotlari donasini tanlash / Dengiz mahsulotlari donasini qanday tanlash kerak

69
00:03:30,175 --> 00:03:34,142
Yana bir narsa yeyishni xohlayman.

70
00:03:34,165 --> 00:03:35,532
Nima?

71
00:03:35,555 --> 00:03:38,521
Dengiz mahsulotlari donasi.

72
00:03:38,544 --> 00:03:41,979
Siz endigina sushi yedingiz-ku?

73
00:03:42,003 --> 00:03:44,836
Shunga qaramay, yeyishni xohlayman.

74
00:03:44,859 --> 00:03:46,829
Tushunarli.

75
00:03:46,853 --> 00:03:50,301
Oedo degan doʻkonga boring.

76
00:03:50,324 --> 00:03:52,924
U ham mashhurmi?

77
00:03:52,947 --> 00:03:57,355
Ha, dengiz mahsulotlari donasi bilan mashhur doʻkon.

78
00:03:57,379 --> 00:03:59,179
Shu yerda ekanmi?

79
00:03:59,202 --> 00:04:02,235
Menyuda juda koʻp taomlar bor.

80
00:04:02,258 --> 00:04:04,458
Qaysi birini tanlaysiz?

81
00:04:04,481 --> 00:04:07,748
Men ikra donasini tanlayman.

82
00:04:07,771 --> 00:04:11,538
Men esa dengiz kirpi va ikra.

83
00:04:11,561 --> 00:04:13,961
Hashamatli ekan!

84
00:04:13,984 --> 00:04:17,075
Ha, juda kutgandim.

85
00:04:17,098 --> 00:04:19,732
A, keldi!

86
00:04:19,755 --> 00:04:23,488
Vaa, donalar porlayapti!

87
00:04:23,511 --> 00:04:26,198
Soʻyani quyasizmi?

88
00:04:26,222 --> 00:04:29,555
Ha, ozgina.

89
00:04:29,578 --> 00:04:31,476
Yeyishni boshlaymiz.

90
00:04:31,500 --> 00:04:34,515
Bu ham juda zoʻr ekan!

91
00:04:34,538 --> 00:04:37,835
Dengiz kirpisi shirin va ogʻzida eriydi.

92
00:04:37,859 --> 00:04:41,025
Ikra ham serelastik.

93
00:04:41,048 --> 00:04:43,882
Rostdan ham juda mazali!

94
00:04:43,905 --> 00:04:46,638
Guruch koʻrinmayapti-ku!

95
00:04:46,661 --> 00:04:50,428
Baliq juda koʻp solingan.

96
00:04:50,451 --> 00:04:52,984
Bu hashamatli vaqt ekan.

97
00:04:53,007 --> 00:04:55,685
Oedo juda mazali ekan, shundaymi?

98
00:04:55,708 --> 00:04:59,566
Ha, albatta yana kelamiz.

99
00:04:59,590 --> 00:05:01,090
4-SAHNA: Tunets baliqlarining savdosini koʻrish / Tunets baliqlarining savdosiga tashrif

100
00:05:01,090 --> 00:05:04,534
Tunets baliqlarining savdosini koʻrishga boring.

101
00:05:04,558 --> 00:05:07,047
Qayerda koʻrish mumkin?

102
00:05:07,070 --> 00:05:10,204
Ekskursiya marshruti bor.

103
00:05:10,227 --> 00:05:12,660
Bu yerdan uzoqmi?

104
00:05:12,683 --> 00:05:15,776
Yo'q. Yaqin.

105
00:05:15,799 --> 00:05:19,092
Tuna baliqlari ko'p ekan, shunday emasmi?

106
00:05:19,116 --> 00:05:22,882
Ha. Juda katta.

107
00:05:22,905 --> 00:05:25,939
Bozorda ichi sovuqmi?

108
00:05:25,962 --> 00:05:29,095
Biroz sovuq.

109
00:05:29,118 --> 00:05:31,595
Kurtka olib keldim.

110
00:05:31,619 --> 00:05:34,595
Yaxshi qildingiz.

111
00:05:34,618 --> 00:05:38,088
Ular nima qilyapti?

112
00:05:38,112 --> 00:05:42,151
Tuna baliqlarining narxini belgilayapti.

113
00:05:42,174 --> 00:05:45,648
Ovozlari yaxshi eshitilmayapti, shundaymi?

114
00:05:45,672 --> 00:05:47,909
Shisha borligi uchun.

115
00:05:47,932 --> 00:05:51,466
Lekin juda qiziqarli.

116
00:05:51,489 --> 00:05:54,689
Ko'rishga muvaffaq bo'ldik, yaxshi bo'ldi.

117
00:05:54,712 --> 00:05:57,846
Har doim soat nechida boshlanadi?

118
00:05:57,869 --> 00:06:01,044
Ertalab soat besh yarimdan.

119
00:06:01,067 --> 00:06:03,712
Juda erta ekan-ku!

120
00:06:03,735 --> 00:06:08,183
Ha. Biz biroz kechikib qoldik.

121
00:06:08,206 --> 00:06:11,419
Birozgina ko'rdik.

122
00:06:11,443 --> 00:06:15,702
Ha. Keyinroq yana ko'ramiz.

123
00:06:15,726 --> 00:06:18,759
Erta turishimiz kerak bo'ladi-ku.

124
00:06:18,782 --> 00:06:20,749
Shunday.

125
00:06:20,772 --> 00:06:24,539
Lekin bozor muhitini tushunib oldik.

126
00:06:24,562 --> 00:06:28,328
Bu yerda rasmga tushamizmi?

127
00:06:28,351 --> 00:06:30,385
Ha. Iltimos.

128
00:06:30,408 --> 00:06:32,974
Yaxshi rasm chiqdi.

129
00:06:32,997 --> 00:06:35,131
Rahmat.

130
00:06:35,153 --> 00:06:36,653
5-SAHNA: Sovg'a uchun pichoq tanlash

131
00:06:36,653 --> 00:06:39,654
Sovg'a olamiz.

132
00:06:39,678 --> 00:06:41,811
Nima buyurtma qilamiz?

133
00:06:41,834 --> 00:06:44,853
Pichoq do'koni bor.

134
00:06:44,877 --> 00:06:47,244
Ko'rib chiqmoqchiman.

135
00:06:47,267 --> 00:06:49,279
Boramiz.

136
00:06:49,302 --> 00:06:52,468
Pichoqlar ko'p ekan.

137
00:06:52,491 --> 00:06:55,091
Juda porloq.

138
00:06:55,114 --> 00:06:58,481
Juda yaxshi kesadidek ko'rinadi.

139
00:06:58,504 --> 00:07:01,271
Professional asbob ekan.

140
00:07:01,294 --> 00:07:04,694
Men ham pishirishni yaxshi ko'raman.

141
00:07:04,717 --> 00:07:07,321
Bittasini sotib olasizmi?

142
00:07:07,344 --> 00:07:10,230
Narxi qancha?

143
00:07:10,253 --> 00:07:13,226
Taxminan o'n ming yen.

144
00:07:13,250 --> 00:07:16,384
Biroz qimmat ekan.

145
00:07:16,407 --> 00:07:20,340
Lekin uzoq vaqt ishlatishingiz mumkin.

146
00:07:20,363 --> 00:07:21,963
Shunday.

147
00:07:21,986 --> 00:07:26,353
Pichoqqa ism yozib berish mumkin.

148
00:07:26,376 --> 00:07:29,242
Bu ajoyib ekan-ku!

149
00:07:29,265 --> 00:07:32,465
Sovg'a sifatida ham yaxshi.

150
00:07:32,488 --> 00:07:35,088
Otamga sotib olaymi, deb o'ylayapman.

151
00:07:35,112 --> 00:07:38,201
Albatta xursand bo'ladi.

152
00:07:38,225 --> 00:07:39,991
Kechirasiz.

153
00:07:40,014 --> 00:07:42,348
Buni ko'rsating.

154
00:07:42,371 --> 00:07:45,538
Juda chiroyli pichoq ekan.

155
00:07:45,562 --> 00:07:48,496
Mana shuni tanlayman.

156
00:07:48,519 --> 00:07:51,452
Yaxshi xarid qildingiz-ku.

157
00:07:51,475 --> 00:07:55,008
Ha. Juda xursandman.

158
00:07:55,031 --> 00:07:57,764
Ishlatishni intiqlik bilan kutmoqdaman.

159
00:07:57,787 --> 00:08:01,266
Ha. Pishirishga harakat qilaman.

160
00:08:01,290 --> 00:08:04,056
Ehtiyotkorlik bilan foydalaning.

161
00:08:04,079 --> 00:08:06,646
Albatta.

162
00:08:06,669 --> 00:08:08,169
6-Sahna: Tamagoyaki doʻkoni – Marutake / Marutake: Yaponiyaning mashhur yapon omleti doʻkoni

163
00:08:08,169 --> 00:08:12,202
U yerda shirin hid kelayapti.

164
00:08:12,225 --> 00:08:14,643
Marutake ekan.

165
00:08:14,667 --> 00:08:18,350
Marutake qanday doʻkon?

166
00:08:18,373 --> 00:08:21,574
Yapon omleti (tamagoyaki) doʻkoni.

167
00:08:21,598 --> 00:08:23,896
Mashhur doʻkonmi?

168
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:27,453
Ha. Juda mashhur.

169
00:08:27,476 --> 00:08:30,365
Bitta tatib koʻraylik.

170
00:08:30,389 --> 00:08:32,789
Choʻpga sanchilgan.

171
00:08:32,812 --> 00:08:35,045
Yeyish qulay ekan.

172
00:08:35,068 --> 00:08:38,268
Issiq, ehtiyot boʻling.

173
00:08:38,291 --> 00:08:40,324
Yeyishni boshlaymiz.

174
00:08:40,347 --> 00:08:42,715
Tami qanday?

175
00:08:42,739 --> 00:08:45,539
Juda shirin.

176
00:08:45,562 --> 00:08:48,330
Shirinlikka oʻxshaydi-ku.

177
00:08:48,353 --> 00:08:51,156
Ha. Puf-puf.

178
00:08:51,180 --> 00:08:53,954
Dashi (yapon bulyoni) taʼmi sezilayapti.

179
00:08:53,977 --> 00:08:57,813
Yapon omleti juda mazali ekan.

180
00:08:57,836 --> 00:09:00,609
Sovgʻa sifatida sotib olaylikmi?

181
00:09:00,632 --> 00:09:04,166
Ha. Oilam uchun olmoqchiman.

182
00:09:04,189 --> 00:09:06,407
Saqlash muddati qancha?

183
00:09:06,430 --> 00:09:09,564
Doʻkon egasiga soʻrab koʻraylik.

184
00:09:09,587 --> 00:09:13,244
Muzlatgichda 3 kun saqlanadi ekan.

185
00:09:13,267 --> 00:09:15,701
Unda muammo yoʻq.

186
00:09:15,725 --> 00:09:18,492
Kattasini sotib olaylik.

187
00:09:18,515 --> 00:09:21,481
Xursand boʻlishadi, deb umid qilaman.

188
00:09:21,504 --> 00:09:24,590
Albatta xursand boʻlishadi.

189
00:09:24,614 --> 00:09:28,663
Marutake tamagoyakisi eng zoʻridir.

190
00:09:28,687 --> 00:09:31,654
Ha. Yana yeyishni xohlayman.

191
00:09:31,677 --> 00:09:34,643
Boshqa doʻkonlar ham bor.

192
00:09:34,666 --> 00:09:37,100
Koʻp narsalarni koʻrib chiqaylik.

193
00:09:37,123 --> 00:09:38,623
7-Sahna: Dam olish va Dango / Dam olish va Dango

194
00:09:38,623 --> 00:09:41,518
Bir oz charchadim.

195
00:09:41,541 --> 00:09:44,633
Qayerdadir dam olamiz.

196
00:09:44,657 --> 00:09:48,143
Mosuke dango bor ekan.

197
00:09:48,166 --> 00:09:51,166
Mosuke dango?

198
00:09:51,189 --> 00:09:55,882
Ha. Qadimiy yapon shirinliklari doʻkoni.

199
00:09:55,906 --> 00:09:59,073
Dango mazali boʻladi-ku?

200
00:09:59,096 --> 00:10:03,029
Ha. Juda mazali.

201
00:10:03,052 --> 00:10:05,942
Choy ham ichish mumkinmi?

202
00:10:05,965 --> 00:10:09,765
Ha. Issiq choy bor.

203
00:10:09,788 --> 00:10:12,222
Ichkariga kiramiz.

204
00:10:12,245 --> 00:10:14,982
Qaysi birini tanlaysiz?

205
00:10:15,005 --> 00:10:18,973
Men loviya pyuresi solingan dangoni tanlayman.

206
00:10:18,996 --> 00:10:22,263
Men soya sousi bilan dangoni tanlayman.

207
00:10:22,286 --> 00:10:24,286
Yaxshi tanlov!

208
00:10:24,309 --> 00:10:26,883
Choy ham olib keling, iltimos.

209
00:10:26,907 --> 00:10:29,040
Yeyishni boshlaymiz.

210
00:10:29,063 --> 00:10:32,238
Dango juda yumshoq.

211
00:10:32,262 --> 00:10:36,195
Anko shirin va mazali.

212
00:10:36,218 --> 00:10:40,307
Choy bilan juda mos keladi, shunday emasmi?

213
00:10:40,331 --> 00:10:42,465
Rohatimizni tiklaydi.

214
00:10:42,488 --> 00:10:45,904
Mosuke dango juda mashhur.

215
00:10:45,928 --> 00:10:49,468
Ko‘p mijozlar bor ekan.

216
00:10:49,491 --> 00:10:51,661
Rostdan ham!

217
00:10:51,685 --> 00:10:54,519
Yaxshi dam oldik.

218
00:10:54,542 --> 00:10:57,435
Sovg‘alar ham olish mumkin.

219
00:10:57,459 --> 00:11:00,259
Keyinroq olamiz.

220
00:11:00,282 --> 00:11:04,057
Yapon shirinliklari ajoyib ekan.

221
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:07,714
Ha, men ham juda yoqadi.

222
00:11:07,737 --> 00:11:11,633
Endi keyingi joyga o‘tamizmi?

223
00:11:11,656 --> 00:11:14,825
Ha. Ketdik!

224
00:11:14,849 --> 00:11:16,349
8-SAHNA: Baliq qovurilgan do‘kon / Dengiz mahsulotlari qovurilgan restoran

225
00:11:16,349 --> 00:11:20,149
Hali ham yeyish mumkinmi?

226
00:11:20,172 --> 00:11:22,985
Ha, hech muammo yo‘q.

227
00:11:23,009 --> 00:11:25,575
Odabo‘ga boring.

228
00:11:25,598 --> 00:11:29,400
Odabo‘ bu nima do‘koni?

229
00:11:29,423 --> 00:11:32,504
Qovurilgan taomlar do‘koni.

230
00:11:32,528 --> 00:11:35,202
Baliq qovurilgani?

231
00:11:35,226 --> 00:11:39,712
Ha. Jazirmani qovurish juda mashhur.

232
00:11:39,735 --> 00:11:42,785
Juda mazali ko‘rinib turibdi.

233
00:11:42,809 --> 00:11:46,142
Do‘kon ana u yerda.

234
00:11:46,165 --> 00:11:48,578
Menyuni ko‘rib chiqamiz.

235
00:11:48,602 --> 00:11:51,668
Ustritsa qovurilgani ham bor.

236
00:11:51,691 --> 00:11:55,825
Men jazirma qovurmani tanlayman.

237
00:11:55,848 --> 00:11:59,081
Men ustritsa qovurmani tanlayman.

238
00:11:59,104 --> 00:12:02,039
Biroz ulashib oling.

239
00:12:02,062 --> 00:12:04,829
Ha, albatta.

240
00:12:04,852 --> 00:12:07,485
Taomlar keldi.

241
00:12:07,508 --> 00:12:11,585
Jazirma qovurmasi juda katta.

242
00:12:11,608 --> 00:12:14,382
Qarsillab turibdi, shunday emasmi?

243
00:12:14,406 --> 00:12:17,773
Ichki qismi yumshoq.

244
00:12:17,796 --> 00:12:20,629
Sous quyamizmi?

245
00:12:20,652 --> 00:12:23,349
Ha, quyamiz.

246
00:12:23,372 --> 00:12:26,506
Guruch ham yaxshi ketadi.

247
00:12:26,529 --> 00:12:30,507
Ustritsa qovurmasi ham juda mazali.

248
00:12:30,530 --> 00:12:32,786
Bittasini tatib ko‘ray.

249
00:12:32,810 --> 00:12:34,624
Qanday?

250
00:12:34,647 --> 00:12:37,681
Dengiz suti kabi.

251
00:12:37,704 --> 00:12:41,564
Odabo‘ ham ajoyib ekan.

252
00:12:41,587 --> 00:12:44,661
Baliq qovurish juda yaxshi.

253
00:12:44,684 --> 00:12:48,451
Rostdan ham qorni to‘ldi.

254
00:12:48,474 --> 00:12:50,907
Ko‘p rahmat, mazali bo‘ldi.

255
00:12:50,930 --> 00:12:52,430
9-SAHNA: Tom ustidagi manzara / Tom ustidagi ajoyib ko‘rinish

256
00:12:52,430 --> 00:12:55,432
Tom ustida bog‘ bor.

257
00:12:55,456 --> 00:12:57,590
Borib ko‘raylik.

258
00:12:57,612 --> 00:13:00,106
Lift bilan yuqoriga chiqamiz.

259
00:13:00,130 --> 00:13:03,738
Vov, osmon juda keng!

260
00:13:03,761 --> 00:13:06,961
Manzara juda chiroyli ekan.

261
00:13:06,985 --> 00:13:09,725
Dengiz ko‘rinib turibdi.

262
00:13:09,748 --> 00:13:12,581
Kamalak koʻprigini ham koʻryapsiz.

263
00:13:12,604 --> 00:13:16,138
Rostdan ham. Chiroyli ekan.

264
00:13:16,161 --> 00:13:19,327
Shamol juda yoqimli esayapti.

265
00:13:19,350 --> 00:13:21,798
Maysazor bor ekan-ku.

266
00:13:21,822 --> 00:13:24,755
Biroz dam olsakmi?

267
00:13:24,778 --> 00:13:27,848
Ha, piyoda yurib charchadik.

268
00:13:27,872 --> 00:13:30,562
Shu skameykaga oʻtiramiz.

269
00:13:30,585 --> 00:13:33,785
Bu yer juda tinch ekan.

270
00:13:33,808 --> 00:13:37,080
Bozor ichi gavjum edi, shundaymi?

271
00:13:37,103 --> 00:13:41,318
Ha, bu yer butunlay boshqa dunyo kabi.

272
00:13:41,342 --> 00:13:43,878
Tungi manzara ham juda chiroyli.

273
00:13:43,901 --> 00:13:46,468
Tungi paytda ham kirish mumkinmi?

274
00:13:46,491 --> 00:13:49,470
Ha, tungacha ochiq.

275
00:13:49,494 --> 00:13:51,951
Uchrashuv uchun juda yaxshi joy.

276
00:13:51,974 --> 00:13:54,008
Shunday.

277
00:13:54,030 --> 00:13:56,997
Tokio minorasini ham koʻrish mumkinmi?

278
00:13:57,020 --> 00:13:59,953
Ana u tomonda koʻrinadi.

279
00:13:59,976 --> 00:14:02,543
Juda yaxshi joy ekan.

280
00:14:02,566 --> 00:14:04,966
Siz uchun rasmga tushib beraman.

281
00:14:04,989 --> 00:14:06,824
Rahmat.

282
00:14:06,847 --> 00:14:09,727
Ha, „pishloq“!

283
00:14:09,751 --> 00:14:11,807
Juda yaxshi rasm chiqdi.

284
00:14:11,831 --> 00:14:14,364
Yaxshi dam oldik, shundaymi?

285
00:14:14,387 --> 00:14:17,721
Ha, endi kuch-quvvat paydo boʻldi.

286
00:14:17,743 --> 00:14:19,243
10-sahna: Toyosu va Odaibani kashf etish

287
00:14:19,243 --> 00:14:24,177
Endi ketish vaqti keldi, shundaymi? Allaqachon shuncha vaqt boʻldi-ku.

288
00:14:24,200 --> 00:14:27,674
Senkyakubanrayga boring.

289
00:14:27,697 --> 00:14:29,736
U nima?

290
00:14:29,759 --> 00:14:32,559
Yangi inshoot.

291
00:14:32,582 --> 00:14:35,616
Koʻp doʻkonlar bor ekan.

292
00:14:35,639 --> 00:14:38,406
Edo shahri kabi.

293
00:14:38,429 --> 00:14:40,844
Issiq buloq ham bor.

294
00:14:40,867 --> 00:14:44,401
Ha, oyoq vannasiga tushaylik.

295
00:14:44,424 --> 00:14:47,063
Juda yoqimli ekan.

296
00:14:47,087 --> 00:14:49,784
Manzara ham yaxshi.

297
00:14:49,808 --> 00:14:52,575
Koʻcha boʻylab ovqatlanish ham mumkin.

298
00:14:52,598 --> 00:14:55,731
Ha, juda qiziqarli joy.

299
00:14:55,754 --> 00:14:59,208
Toyosu ajoyib joy ekan.

300
00:14:59,232 --> 00:15:01,811
Keyin qayerga boramiz?

301
00:15:01,835 --> 00:15:04,635
Odaibaga borishni istayman.

302
00:15:04,658 --> 00:15:07,391
Yurikamomega chiqaylik.

303
00:15:07,414 --> 00:15:09,263
Bekat qayerda?

304
00:15:09,286 --> 00:15:11,686
Shu yerda, yaqin.

305
00:15:11,709 --> 00:15:14,514
Yukim ogʻir ekan.

306
00:15:14,538 --> 00:15:17,435
Koʻp suvenirlar sotib oldim.

307
00:15:17,458 --> 00:15:20,306
Ha, juda mamnunman.

308
00:15:20,329 --> 00:15:23,933
Yurikamomedan koʻrinadigan manzara ham yaxshi.

309
00:15:23,957 --> 00:15:27,090
Dengiz ustidan oʻtadi, shundaymi?

310
00:15:27,113 --> 00:15:29,784
Ha, juda qiziqarli boʻladi.

311
00:15:29,807 --> 00:15:32,641
Odaibada ham dam olamiz.

312
00:15:32,664 --> 00:15:36,037
Endi, poyezdda ketamiz.

313
00:15:36,060 --> 00:15:38,627
Ha, joʻnab ketamiz!

314
00:15:38,650 --> 00:15:41,820
Bugun haqiqatan ham juda yoqimli boʻldi.

315
00:15:41,843 --> 00:15:44,176
Katta raxmat.

316
00:15:53,835 --> 00:15:55,335
Sahna 1: Toyosu bozorini tanishtirish

317
00:15:55,335 --> 00:15:59,603
Tinglash testi

318
00:15:59,603 --> 00:16:04,670
Bu yer Toyosu bozori.

319
00:16:04,670 --> 00:16:11,577
N1 — N2 = N1 bu N2
Bozor = bozor

320
00:16:11,601 --> 00:16:14,671
Tinglash testi

321
00:16:14,671 --> 00:16:18,243
Juda katta ekan!

322
00:16:18,243 --> 00:16:23,176
いA + desu ne = [sifat] ekan, shunday emasmi?
Katta [katta] ↔ Kichik [kichik]

323
00:16:23,199 --> 00:16:28,699
Tinglash testi

324
00:16:28,699 --> 00:16:35,286
Ha. Yangi va toza bozor.

325
00:16:35,286 --> 00:16:44,237
いAくて + なAな + N = [sifat] va [sifat] N
Yangi [yangi] ↔ Eski [eski]
Toza/chiroyli [toza/chiroyli] ↔ Kir [kir]

326
00:16:44,261 --> 00:16:48,028
Tinglash testi

327
00:16:48,028 --> 00:16:52,461
Tsukiji bozoridan ham kattaroqmi?

328
00:16:52,461 --> 00:16:58,536
N1 dan koʻra N2 = N2 N1dan koʻra yaxshiroq

329
00:16:58,560 --> 00:17:02,460
Tinglash testi

330
00:17:02,460 --> 00:17:07,051
Ha. Juda keng.

331
00:17:07,051 --> 00:17:13,351
Juda + いA = juda [sifat]
Keng [keng] ↔ Tor [tor]

332
00:17:13,374 --> 00:17:16,722
Tinglash testi

333
00:17:16,722 --> 00:17:20,656
Odamlar koʻp ekan-ku!

334
00:17:20,656 --> 00:17:26,089
N koʻp (jonli narsalar) bor = Koʻp N bor
Koʻp [koʻp] ↔ Kam [kam]

335
00:17:26,112 --> 00:17:29,912
Tinglash testi

336
00:17:29,912 --> 00:17:34,388
Chet ellik sayyohlar ham koʻp.

337
00:17:34,388 --> 00:17:40,555
N ham koʻp = N ham koʻp
Sayohatchi [sayohatchi] ≈ Turist [turist]

338
00:17:40,577 --> 00:17:44,959
Tinglash testi

339
00:17:44,959 --> 00:17:50,193
Har kuni soat nechada ochiladi?

340
00:17:50,193 --> 00:17:57,304
N dan = N dan / N dan boshlab
Ochilmoq [ochilmoq] ↔ Yopilmoq [yopilmoq]

341
00:17:57,328 --> 00:18:00,674
Tinglash testi

342
00:18:00,674 --> 00:18:04,583
Ertalabdan boshlab ochiq boʻladi.

343
00:18:04,583 --> 00:18:09,974
いAく = [feʼl shaklidagi sifat]
Erta [erta] ↔ Kech [kech]

344
00:18:09,997 --> 00:18:13,230
Tinglash testi

345
00:18:13,230 --> 00:18:16,977
Metro bekat qayerda?

346
00:18:16,977 --> 00:18:22,132
Qayerda joylashgan? = [jonli boʻlmagan narsa] qayerda?
Bekat = poyezd bekati

347
00:18:22,156 --> 00:18:25,714
Tinglash testi

348
00:18:25,714 --> 00:18:29,886
Bekat shu yerda.

349
00:18:29,886 --> 00:18:35,619
N [joyda] = N [joyda] joylashgan
Shu yerda = shu yerda / juda yaqin

350
00:18:35,642 --> 00:18:38,342
Tinglash testi

351
00:18:38,342 --> 00:18:41,445
Juda qulay ekan!

352
00:18:41,445 --> 00:18:45,752
なA + desu ne = [sifat] ekan, shunday emasmi?
Qulay [qulay] ↔ Noqulay [noqulay]

353
00:18:45,775 --> 00:18:49,875
Tinglash testi

354
00:18:49,875 --> 00:18:54,742
Ha. Yomgʻirli kunlarda ham muammo yoʻq.

355
00:18:54,742 --> 00:19:01,375
N ham yaxshi = N ham yaxshi / muammo yoʻq
Yomgʻir = yomgʻir
Yaxshi = yaxshi / muammo yoʻq

356
00:19:01,398 --> 00:19:04,832
Tinglash testi

357
00:19:04,832 --> 00:19:08,826
Tez ichkariga kiramiz.

358
00:19:08,826 --> 00:19:14,326
V qilaylik = V qilaylik
Kirmoq [kirmoq] ↔ Chiqmoq [chiqmoq]

359
00:19:14,349 --> 00:19:17,495
Tinglash testi

360
00:19:17,495 --> 00:19:21,161
Ha. Ketdik!

361
00:19:21,161 --> 00:19:26,228
Boraylik = Boraylik
Bormoq [bormoq] ↔ Kelmoq [kelmoq]

362
00:19:26,251 --> 00:19:29,884
Tinglash testi

363
00:19:29,884 --> 00:19:34,118
Baliq hidi kelayapti-ku!

364
00:19:34,118 --> 00:19:39,951
N hidi kelmoqda = N hidi kelmoqda
Baliq = baliq
Hid = hid / is

365
00:19:39,974 --> 00:19:44,041
Tinglash testi

366
00:19:44,041 --> 00:19:48,837
Chunki yangi baliqlar koʻp.

367
00:19:48,837 --> 00:19:55,395
Chunki = chunki / sababi
Yangilik = yangi / toza

368
00:19:55,418 --> 00:19:59,285
Tinglash testi

369
00:19:59,285 --> 00:20:03,851
Och qoldim men.

370
00:20:03,851 --> 00:20:10,118
Qorni ochdi = Och qoldim
Qorin = qorin

371
00:20:10,141 --> 00:20:13,713
Tinglash testi

372
00:20:13,713 --> 00:20:17,946
Bu yerda koʻp restoranlar bor.

373
00:20:17,946 --> 00:20:23,713
N koʻp (jonli boʻlmagan narsalar) bor = Koʻp N bor

374
00:20:23,736 --> 00:20:26,890
Tinglash testi

375
00:20:26,890 --> 00:20:30,561
Nima yeyishimiz mumkin?

376
00:20:30,561 --> 00:20:35,628
Nima qilaylik? = Nima qilaylik?
Yemoq [yemoq] ↔ Ichmoq [ichmoq]

377
00:20:35,651 --> 00:20:39,027
Tinglash testi

378
00:20:39,027 --> 00:20:42,984
Mazali ovqatlar koʻp.

379
00:20:42,984 --> 00:20:48,417
いA + N = [sifat] N
Mazali [mazali] ↔ Mazasiz [mazasiz]
Doʻkon = doʻkon / restoran

380
00:20:48,440 --> 00:20:51,310
Tinglash testi

381
00:20:51,310 --> 00:20:54,643
Qaysi joy yaxshi?

382
00:20:54,643 --> 00:20:59,225
Qayer yaxshi? = Qaysi joyni tavsiya qilasiz?
Yaxshi [yaxshi] ↔ Yomon [yomon]

383
00:20:59,249 --> 00:21:02,516
Tinglash testi

384
00:21:02,516 --> 00:21:06,301
Birga izlaymiz.

385
00:21:06,301 --> 00:21:11,534
Birga V qilaylik = Birga V qilaylik
Birga = birga
Qidirmoq = qidirmoq / izlamoq

386
00:21:11,557 --> 00:21:14,790
Tinglash testi

387
00:21:14,790 --> 00:21:18,547
Ana u yerda xarita bor.

388
00:21:18,547 --> 00:21:23,740
[Joyda] N bor = [Joyda] N bor
Xarita [xarita] ≈ Xarita [xarita]

389
00:21:23,763 --> 00:21:26,263
Tinglash testi

390
00:21:26,263 --> 00:21:29,130
Qaraylik.

391
00:21:29,130 --> 00:21:33,111
V qilib koʻraylik = V qilib koʻraylik
Koʻrmoq = koʻrmoq / tomosha qilmoq

392
00:21:33,134 --> 00:21:36,852
Tinglash testi

393
00:21:36,852 --> 00:21:41,236
Restoranlar yuqori qavatda ekan.

394
00:21:41,236 --> 00:21:47,269
N1 ning N2 = N1 ning N2
Yuqori [yuqori] ↔ Past [past]
Qavat = qavat / qavat

395
00:21:47,292 --> 00:21:50,126
Tinglash testi

396
00:21:50,126 --> 00:21:53,426
Lift bor.

397
00:21:53,426 --> 00:21:57,960
N bor = N bor
Lift = lift

398
00:21:57,983 --> 00:22:00,783
Tinglash testi

399
00:22:00,783 --> 00:22:04,049
Unga chiqamiz.

400
00:22:04,049 --> 00:22:08,549
N ga chiqaylik = N ga chiqaylik / minaylik
Minmoq [minmoq] ↔ Tushmoq [tushmoq]

401
00:22:08,572 --> 00:22:11,324
Tinglash testi

402
00:22:11,324 --> 00:22:14,492
Juda qiziq ekan!

403
00:22:14,492 --> 00:22:18,876
N ekan, shunday emasmi? = N ekan, shunday emasmi?
Kutish = intizorlik / zavq

404
00:22:18,900 --> 00:22:22,452
Tinglash testi

405
00:22:22,452 --> 00:22:26,607
Ha. Tezroq boring.

406
00:22:26,607 --> 00:22:32,307
Shoshilaylik = Shoshilaylik
Shoshilmoq = shoshilmoq

407
00:22:32,331 --> 00:22:33,831
Sahna 2: Mashhur sushi restoranida navbat kutish

408
00:22:33,831 --> 00:22:37,298
Tinglash testi

409
00:22:37,298 --> 00:22:41,364
Bu restoran qanday?

410
00:22:41,364 --> 00:22:46,943
N qanday? = N qanday?
Doʻkon = doʻkon, restoran

411
00:22:46,967 --> 00:22:51,241
Tinglash testi

412
00:22:51,241 --> 00:22:56,313
Odamlar koʻp navbatda turibdi-ku!

413
00:22:56,313 --> 00:23:03,247
V qilmoqda = V qilmoqda
Navbatda turmoq = navbatda turmoq

414
00:23:03,270 --> 00:23:06,548
Tinglash testi

415
00:23:06,548 --> 00:23:10,382
Bu yer Sushi Dai.

416
00:23:10,382 --> 00:23:15,661
Bu yerda N = Bu yerda N
Sushi = sushi

417
00:23:15,684 --> 00:23:18,317
Tinglash testi

418
00:23:18,317 --> 00:23:21,310
Sushi Dai debmi?

419
00:23:21,310 --> 00:23:25,455
Nmi? = Nmi?

420
00:23:25,479 --> 00:23:27,512
Ha.

421
00:23:27,535 --> 00:23:30,835
Tinglash testi

422
00:23:30,835 --> 00:23:34,702
Juda mashhur restoran.

423
00:23:34,702 --> 00:23:40,002
なA + na + N = [na-sifat] N
Mashhur [mashhur] ↔ Nomaʼlum [nomaʼlum]

424
00:23:40,025 --> 00:23:43,492
Tinglash testi

425
00:23:43,492 --> 00:23:47,558
Eng mashhuri shu yerda-mi?

426
00:23:47,558 --> 00:23:53,132
Eng + N = eng N
Mashhurlik = mashhurlik

427
00:23:53,156 --> 00:23:55,089
Ha.

428
00:23:55,112 --> 00:23:58,262
Tinglash testi

429
00:23:58,262 --> 00:24:01,932
Har doim navbat boʻladi.

430
00:24:01,932 --> 00:24:06,999
Har doim + V = har doim V
Navbat = navbat, очередь

431
00:24:07,022 --> 00:24:10,530
Tinglash testi

432
00:24:10,530 --> 00:24:14,650
Biroz kutamizmi?

433
00:24:14,650 --> 00:24:20,317
V qilaylikmi? = V qilaylikmi?
Biroz [biroz] ↔ Koʻp [koʻp]
Kutmoq = kutmoq

434
00:24:20,340 --> 00:24:22,040
Ha.

435
00:24:22,063 --> 00:24:24,329
Tinglash testi

436
00:24:24,329 --> 00:24:26,871
Navbatga turamiz.

437
00:24:26,871 --> 00:24:30,406
Navbatga turaylik = Navbatga turaylik
Navbatda turmoq = navbatda turmoq

438
00:24:30,430 --> 00:24:33,763
Tinglash testi

439
00:24:33,763 --> 00:24:37,663
Tashqarida menyu bor.

440
00:24:37,663 --> 00:24:42,996
N da N bor = N da N bor
Tashqarida [tashqarida] ↔ Ichkarida [ichkarida]
Menyu = menyu

441
00:24:43,019 --> 00:24:45,697
Tinglash testi

442
00:24:45,697 --> 00:24:48,797
Nima buyurtma qilamiz?

443
00:24:48,797 --> 00:24:53,097
Nima yaxshi boʻlardi? = Nima yaxshi boʻlardi?

444
00:24:53,120 --> 00:24:56,587
Tinglash testi

445
00:24:56,587 --> 00:25:00,627
Men tuna baliqni yaxshi koʻraman.

446
00:25:00,627 --> 00:25:06,184
N yoqadi = N yoqadi
Tuna = tuna
Yoqmoq [yoqmoq] ↔ Yoqmaslik [yoqmaslik]

447
00:25:06,208 --> 00:25:09,108
Tinglash testi

448
00:25:09,108 --> 00:25:12,455
Yaxshi tanlov!

449
00:25:12,455 --> 00:25:17,088
Yaxshi ekan = Yaxshi eshitilmoqda

450
00:25:17,111 --> 00:25:20,411
Tinglash testi

451
00:25:20,411 --> 00:25:24,245
Set menyu ham bor.

452
00:25:24,245 --> 00:25:29,545
N ham bor = N ham bor
Set = set menyu, kombinatsiya

453
00:25:29,568 --> 00:25:33,122
Tinglash testi

454
00:25:33,122 --> 00:25:37,295
Har xil baliqlar bor ekan!

455
00:25:37,295 --> 00:25:43,012
Turli xil + N = turli xil N
Turli xil = turli xil
Baliq = baliq

456
00:25:43,035 --> 00:25:46,173
Tinglash testi

457
00:25:46,173 --> 00:25:49,840
Nima ichmoqchisiz?

458
00:25:49,840 --> 00:25:54,874
N ni tanlaymiz = N ni tanlaymiz
Ichimlik [ichimlik] ↔ Taom [taom]

459
00:25:54,897 --> 00:25:58,197
Tinglash testi

460
00:25:58,197 --> 00:26:02,064
Iltimli choy, iltimos.

461
00:26:02,064 --> 00:26:07,397
N ni iltimos qilamiz = N ni iltimos
Issiq [issiq] ↔ Sovuq [sovuq]
Choy = koʻk choy, choy

462
00:26:07,420 --> 00:26:10,453
Tinglash testi

463
00:26:10,453 --> 00:26:13,953
Men ham xuddi shunday.

464
00:26:13,953 --> 00:26:18,787
N + ham bir xil = N ham bir xil
Bir xil (bir xil) ↔ Turli (turli)

465
00:26:18,810 --> 00:26:22,676
Tinglash testi

466
00:26:22,676 --> 00:26:27,229
Navbat endi bizniki.

467
00:26:27,229 --> 00:26:33,496
Keyingi + N + boʻladi = Keyingi N
Keyingi = keyingi
Navbat = navbat, tartib

468
00:26:33,519 --> 00:26:37,033
Tinglash testi

469
00:26:37,033 --> 00:26:41,166
Doʻkonda juda toza ekan, shunday emasmi?

470
00:26:41,166 --> 00:26:46,840
N + ichida = N ichida
Ichida (ichida) ↔ Tashqarida (tashqarida)
Toza (toza, chiroyli) ↔ Kir (iflos)

471
00:26:46,864 --> 00:26:50,020
Tinglash testi

472
00:26:50,020 --> 00:26:53,693
Usta koʻrinib turibdi.

473
00:26:53,693 --> 00:26:58,760
N + koʻrinadi = N koʻrinadi / koʻrinib turibdi
Usta = hunarmand, oshpaz
Koʻrinmoq = koʻrinib turmoq

474
00:26:58,783 --> 00:27:02,059
Tinglash testi

475
00:27:02,059 --> 00:27:05,892
Juda zoʻr koʻrinadi!

476
00:27:05,892 --> 00:27:11,159
Juda + sifat = juda [sifat]
Ajoyib (ajoyib) ↔ Yomon (yomon)

477
00:27:11,182 --> 00:27:14,318
Tinglash testi

478
00:27:14,318 --> 00:27:17,984
Sushi keldi!

479
00:27:17,984 --> 00:27:23,018
V+di = V+di (oʻtgan zamon)
Sushi = sushi
Kelmoq (kelmoq) ↔ Bormoq (ketmoq)

480
00:27:23,041 --> 00:27:26,141
Tinglash testi

481
00:27:26,141 --> 00:27:29,712
Vaa, qanday chiroyli!

482
00:27:29,712 --> 00:27:34,645
Sifat + boʻladi = [sifat] boʻladi
Toza (toza, chiroyli) ↔ Kir (iflos)

483
00:27:34,668 --> 00:27:37,004
Tinglash testi

484
00:27:37,004 --> 00:27:39,671
Yeyishni boshlaymiz.

485
00:27:39,671 --> 00:27:43,376
Iltimos, yeyishni boshlaymiz (ovqatdan oldin salomlashish)

486
00:27:43,399 --> 00:27:47,266
Tinglash testi

487
00:27:47,266 --> 00:27:51,811
Juda mazali ekan!

488
00:27:51,811 --> 00:27:58,044
Juda + sifat = juda [sifat]
Mazali (mazali) ↔ Mazasiz (mazasiz)

489
00:27:58,067 --> 00:28:01,021
Tinglash testi

490
00:28:01,021 --> 00:28:04,454
Baliq shirin ekan-ku!

491
00:28:04,454 --> 00:28:09,157
Sifat + ekan, shunday emasmi?
Shirin (shirin) ↔ Achchiq (achchiq)

492
00:28:09,181 --> 00:28:11,551
Tinglash testi

493
00:28:11,551 --> 00:28:14,251
Rostdan ham!

494
00:28:14,251 --> 00:28:17,989
Rostdan ham shunday, shunday emasmi?

495
00:28:18,013 --> 00:28:21,479
Tinglash testi

496
00:28:21,479 --> 00:28:25,518
Juda toʻydim.

497
00:28:25,518 --> 00:28:31,056
Juda / Juda ham + V+di = juda V+di boʻlgan
Qoniqish = qoniqish
Qoniqmoq = qoniqmoq

498
00:28:31,079 --> 00:28:32,579
3-SAHNA: Dengiz mahsulotlari donasini tanlash / Dengiz mahsulotlari donasini qanday tanlash kerak

499
00:28:32,579 --> 00:28:36,779
Tinglash testi

500
00:28:36,779 --> 00:28:41,759
Yana bir narsa yeyishni xohlayman.

501
00:28:41,759 --> 00:28:48,593
V+moqchi + N = N (kimdir) qilmoqchi boʻlgan
Yana bitta = yana bitta / boshqa

502
00:28:48,616 --> 00:28:50,492
Tinglash testi

503
00:28:50,492 --> 00:28:52,566
Nima?

504
00:28:55,522 --> 00:28:58,834
Tinglash testi

505
00:28:58,834 --> 00:29:02,701
Dengiz mahsulotlari donasi.

506
00:29:02,701 --> 00:29:08,034
Dengiz mahsulotlari donburi = dengiz mahsulotlari solingan guruchli taom

507
00:29:08,057 --> 00:29:11,803
Tinglash testi

508
00:29:11,803 --> 00:29:16,236
Siz endigina sushi yedingiz-ku?

509
00:29:16,236 --> 00:29:22,303
V+di = qildi (xushmuomala oʻtgan zamon)
Oldin = biroz oldin / avvalroq

510
00:29:22,326 --> 00:29:25,514
Tinglash testi

511
00:29:25,514 --> 00:29:29,227
Shunga qaramay, yeyishni xohlayman.

512
00:29:29,227 --> 00:29:34,337
Ammo = lekin / biroq

513
00:29:34,361 --> 00:29:36,794
Tinglash testi

514
00:29:36,794 --> 00:29:39,571
Tushunarli.

515
00:29:43,461 --> 00:29:47,219
Tinglash testi

516
00:29:47,219 --> 00:29:51,652
Oedo degan doʻkonga boring.

517
00:29:51,652 --> 00:29:57,719
N1 + deb ataladigan + N2 = N1 deb ataladigan N2
Doʻkon = doʻkon / restoran

518
00:29:57,742 --> 00:30:00,720
Tinglash testi

519
00:30:00,720 --> 00:30:04,186
U ham mashhurmi?

520
00:30:04,186 --> 00:30:08,969
N + ham = ham / ham
Mashhur (mashhur) ↔ Nomaʼlum (nomaʼlum)

521
00:30:08,993 --> 00:30:13,627
Tinglash testi

522
00:30:13,627 --> 00:30:19,129
Ha, dengiz mahsulotlari donasi bilan mashhur doʻkon.

523
00:30:19,129 --> 00:30:26,629
N1 + ning + N2 = N1 ning N2 (otni aniqlovchi)
Mashhur doʻkon = mashhur doʻkon / restoran

524
00:30:26,652 --> 00:30:28,928
Tinglash testi

525
00:30:28,928 --> 00:30:31,498
Shu yerda ekanmi?

526
00:30:35,109 --> 00:30:38,489
Tinglash testi

527
00:30:38,489 --> 00:30:42,441
Menyuda juda koʻp taomlar bor.

528
00:30:42,441 --> 00:30:47,907
N + bor = N bor / mavjud
Menyu = menyu

529
00:30:47,930 --> 00:30:50,564
Tinglash testi

530
00:30:50,564 --> 00:30:53,597
Qaysi birini tanlaysiz?

531
00:30:53,597 --> 00:30:57,773
N + qilib olaman = N ni tanlayman / tanlayman
Qaysi biri = qaysi biri (uch yoki undan ortiqdan)

532
00:30:57,797 --> 00:31:01,389
Tinglash testi

533
00:31:01,389 --> 00:31:05,622
Men ikra donasini tanlayman.

534
00:31:05,622 --> 00:31:11,455
N + qilib olaman = N ni tanlayman / tanlayman
Ikrra = ikra (losos tuxumi)

535
00:31:11,478 --> 00:31:15,545
Tinglash testi

536
00:31:15,545 --> 00:31:20,336
Men esa dengiz kirpi va ikra.

537
00:31:20,336 --> 00:31:26,870
N1 + va + N2 = N1 va N2
Dengiz tipratkoni = dengiz tipratkoni

538
00:31:26,894 --> 00:31:29,727
Tinglash testi

539
00:31:29,727 --> 00:31:32,964
Hashamatli ekan!

540
00:31:32,964 --> 00:31:37,436
Sifat + ekan, shunday emasmi?
Hashamatli (hashamatli) ↔ Oddiy (sodda)

541
00:31:37,459 --> 00:31:40,893
Tinglash testi

542
00:31:40,893 --> 00:31:44,926
Ha, juda kutgandim.

543
00:31:44,926 --> 00:31:50,459
Kutmoq / zavqlanmoq

544
00:31:50,482 --> 00:31:53,516
Tinglash testi

545
00:31:53,516 --> 00:31:57,049
A, keldi!

546
00:32:01,912 --> 00:32:05,910
Tinglash testi

547
00:32:05,910 --> 00:32:10,643
Vaa, donalar porlayapti!

548
00:32:10,643 --> 00:32:17,143
V+moqda = qilmoqda (hozirgi davomli holat)
Donburi = kosa (ovqat kosi)

549
00:32:17,166 --> 00:32:20,242
Tinglash testi

550
00:32:20,242 --> 00:32:23,841
Soʻyani quyasizmi?

551
00:32:23,841 --> 00:32:28,786
N + ni + V = obyekt belgisi ni
Soya sousi = soya sousi

552
00:32:28,809 --> 00:32:32,443
Tinglash testi

553
00:32:32,443 --> 00:32:36,714
Ha, ozgina.

554
00:32:36,714 --> 00:32:42,580
Miqdor + faqat = faqat / atigi
Biroz (ozgina) ↔ Koʻp (koʻp)

555
00:32:42,603 --> 00:32:44,959
Tinglash testi

556
00:32:44,959 --> 00:32:47,659
Yeyishni boshlaymiz.

557
00:32:47,659 --> 00:32:51,406
Iltimos, yeyishni boshlaymiz (ovqatdan oldin ibora)

558
00:32:51,430 --> 00:32:54,799
Tinglash testi

559
00:32:54,799 --> 00:32:58,740
Bu ham juda zoʻr ekan!

560
00:32:58,740 --> 00:33:04,176
N + ham = ham / ham
Eng yaxshi (eng yaxshi) ↔ Eng yomon (eng yomon)

561
00:33:04,200 --> 00:33:07,833
Tinglash testi

562
00:33:07,833 --> 00:33:12,100
Dengiz kirpisi shirin va ogʻzida eriydi.

563
00:33:12,100 --> 00:33:17,967
Sifat+ku = ... va ... (sifatning bogʻlovchi shakli)
Shirin (shirin) ↔ Achchiq (achchiq)
Erib ketmoq = ogʻizda eriydi

564
00:33:17,990 --> 00:33:21,492
Tinglash testi

565
00:33:21,492 --> 00:33:25,600
Ikra ham serelastik.

566
00:33:25,600 --> 00:33:31,233
N + bor = N bor / ega
Elastiklik = elastiklik / qayishqoqlik

567
00:33:31,256 --> 00:33:34,446
Tinglash testi

568
00:33:34,446 --> 00:33:38,179
Rostdan ham juda mazali!

569
00:33:38,179 --> 00:33:43,295
Rostdan = haqiqatan / chinakam

570
00:33:43,318 --> 00:33:46,418
Tinglash testi

571
00:33:46,418 --> 00:33:50,011
Guruch koʻrinmayapti-ku!

572
00:33:50,011 --> 00:33:54,978
V+olmayman = qila olmayman (inkoriy imkoniyat)
Guruch = guruch / taom

573
00:33:55,001 --> 00:33:59,034
Tinglash testi

574
00:33:59,034 --> 00:34:03,791
Baliq juda koʻp solingan.

575
00:34:03,791 --> 00:34:10,300
V+moqda = (natijaviy holat)
Ustida (ustida) ↔ Pastida (pastida)

576
00:34:10,324 --> 00:34:13,258
Tinglash testi

577
00:34:13,258 --> 00:34:16,645
Bu hashamatli vaqt ekan.

578
00:34:16,645 --> 00:34:21,345
Sifat + boʻlgan + N = sifatning otni aniqlovchi shakli
Hashamat = hashamat / hashamatli

579
00:34:21,368 --> 00:34:24,434
Tinglash testi

580
00:34:24,434 --> 00:34:27,990
Oedo juda mazali ekan, shundaymi?

581
00:34:27,990 --> 00:34:32,892
Sifat + ekan, shunday emasmi?
Mazali (mazali) ↔ Mazasiz (mazasiz)

582
00:34:32,915 --> 00:34:37,049
Tinglash testi

583
00:34:37,049 --> 00:34:41,949
Ha, albatta yana kelamiz.

584
00:34:41,949 --> 00:34:48,649
V+aylik = qilaylik
Albatta = albatta / mutlaqo

585
00:34:48,672 --> 00:34:50,172
4-SAHNA: Tunets baliqlarining savdosini koʻrish / Tunets baliqlarining savdosiga tashrif

586
00:34:50,172 --> 00:34:53,926
Tinglash testi

587
00:34:53,926 --> 00:34:58,359
Tunets baliqlarining savdosini koʻrishga boring.

588
00:34:58,359 --> 00:35:04,426
V+moqchi + ga bormoq = V+moq uchun bormoq
Auksion = auksion

589
00:35:04,449 --> 00:35:07,349
Tinglash testi

590
00:35:07,349 --> 00:35:10,715
Qayerda koʻrish mumkin?

591
00:35:10,715 --> 00:35:15,349
V+olish mumkin = V+olish mumkin
Qayerda = qayerda

592
00:35:15,372 --> 00:35:18,844
Tinglash testi

593
00:35:18,844 --> 00:35:22,944
Ekskursiya marshruti bor.

594
00:35:22,944 --> 00:35:28,539
N + bor = N bor
Ekskursiya = ekskursiya / oʻquv safari

595
00:35:28,562 --> 00:35:31,396
Tinglash testi

596
00:35:31,396 --> 00:35:34,670
Bu yerdan uzoqmi?

597
00:35:34,670 --> 00:35:39,205
N + dan = N dan
Uzoq (uzoq) ↔ Yaqin (yaqin)

598
00:35:39,228 --> 00:35:42,695
Tinglash testi

599
00:35:42,695 --> 00:35:46,728
Yo'q. Yaqin.

600
00:35:46,728 --> 00:35:52,262
Sifat + boʻladi = [sifat] boʻladi
Yaqin (yaqin) ↔ Uzoq (uzoq)

601
00:35:52,285 --> 00:35:55,918
Tinglash testi

602
00:35:55,918 --> 00:36:00,185
Tuna baliqlari ko'p ekan, shunday emasmi?

603
00:36:00,185 --> 00:36:06,018
Koʻp + N = koʻp N
Koʻp (koʻp) ↔ Oz (oz)

604
00:36:06,041 --> 00:36:10,108
Tinglash testi

605
00:36:10,108 --> 00:36:14,906
Ha. Juda katta.

606
00:36:14,906 --> 00:36:21,456
Juda + sifat = juda [sifat]
Katta (katta) ↔ Kichik (kichik)

607
00:36:21,479 --> 00:36:24,855
Tinglash testi

608
00:36:24,855 --> 00:36:28,800
Bozorda ichi sovuqmi?

609
00:36:28,800 --> 00:36:34,234
N1 ning N2 = N1 ning N2
Bozor = bozor
Ichida (ichida) ↔ Tashqarida (tashqarida)

610
00:36:34,257 --> 00:36:37,723
Tinglash testi

611
00:36:37,723 --> 00:36:41,760
Biroz sovuq.

612
00:36:41,760 --> 00:36:47,331
Biroz + sifat = biroz [sifat]
Sovuq (sovuq) ↔ Issiq (issiq)

613
00:36:47,355 --> 00:36:50,255
Tinglash testi

614
00:36:50,255 --> 00:36:53,591
Kurtka olib keldim.

615
00:36:53,591 --> 00:36:58,224
V+ib + kelmoq = olib kelmoq / olib kelmoq
Ustki kiyim = kurtka / palto

616
00:36:58,247 --> 00:37:01,581
Tinglash testi

617
00:37:01,581 --> 00:37:05,481
Yaxshi qildingiz.

618
00:37:05,481 --> 00:37:10,822
[gap] + yaxshi boʻldi = ... yaxshi boʻldi

619
00:37:10,845 --> 00:37:14,623
Tinglash testi

620
00:37:14,623 --> 00:37:19,090
Ular nima qilyapti?

621
00:37:19,090 --> 00:37:25,206
V+moqda = V qilmoqda (davomli holat)
U kishilar = u kishilar

622
00:37:25,229 --> 00:37:29,529
Tinglash testi

623
00:37:29,529 --> 00:37:34,634
Tuna baliqlarining narxini belgilayapti.

624
00:37:34,634 --> 00:37:41,589
Vて + いる = V ni hozir bajarayapman (davom etayotgan harakat)
Narx = narx
Qaror qilmoq = qaror qilmoq

625
00:37:41,613 --> 00:37:45,395
Tinglash testi

626
00:37:45,395 --> 00:37:49,861
Ovozlari yaxshi eshitilmayapti, shundaymi?

627
00:37:49,861 --> 00:37:55,978
Vpotential-neg (eshitilmaydi) = eshitolmaydi
Ovoz = ovoz

628
00:37:56,002 --> 00:37:58,672
Tinglash testi

629
00:37:58,672 --> 00:38:01,750
Shisha borligi uchun.

630
00:38:01,750 --> 00:38:06,050
[gap] + дан = chunki...
Shisha = shisha

631
00:38:06,073 --> 00:38:09,906
Tinglash testi

632
00:38:09,906 --> 00:38:14,412
Lekin juda qiziqarli.

633
00:38:14,412 --> 00:38:20,598
Лекин + [gap] = ammo...
Qiziqarli (qiziqarli) ↔ zerikarli (zerikarli)

634
00:38:20,621 --> 00:38:24,159
Tinglash testi

635
00:38:24,159 --> 00:38:28,307
Ko'rishga muvaffaq bo'ldik, yaxshi bo'ldi.

636
00:38:28,307 --> 00:38:34,007
Vて + よかった = V qilganimdan xursandman

637
00:38:34,030 --> 00:38:37,497
Tinglash testi

638
00:38:37,497 --> 00:38:41,563
Har doim soat nechida boshlanadi?

639
00:38:41,563 --> 00:38:47,117
Soat nechada + atrofida = qachon atrofida
Har doim = doimo / odatda

640
00:38:47,141 --> 00:38:50,641
Tinglash testi

641
00:38:50,641 --> 00:38:54,751
Ertalab soat besh yarimdan.

642
00:38:54,751 --> 00:39:00,417
[vaqt] + dan = [vaqt]dan boshlab
Ertalab (ertalab) ↔ Kechqurun (kechqurun)

643
00:39:00,440 --> 00:39:03,474
Tinglash testi

644
00:39:03,474 --> 00:39:07,007
Juda erta ekan-ku!

645
00:39:07,007 --> 00:39:11,874
Juda + sifat = juda [sifat]
Erta (erta) ↔ Kech (kech)

646
00:39:11,897 --> 00:39:16,563
Tinglash testi

647
00:39:16,563 --> 00:39:22,130
Ha. Biz biroz kechikib qoldik.

648
00:39:22,130 --> 00:39:29,707
Biz / bizlar = biz / bizlar
Kech (kech) ↔ Erta (erta)

649
00:39:29,731 --> 00:39:33,281
Tinglash testi

650
00:39:33,281 --> 00:39:37,451
Birozgina ko'rdik.

651
00:39:37,451 --> 00:39:43,184
[miqdor] + dan boshqa + Vneg = faqat
Biroz = ozgina

652
00:39:43,207 --> 00:39:47,685
Tinglash testi

653
00:39:47,685 --> 00:39:53,026
Ha. Keyinroq yana ko'ramiz.

654
00:39:53,026 --> 00:40:00,326
Yana + [gap] = yana / keyingi safar
Keyingi = keyingi

655
00:40:00,349 --> 00:40:03,723
Tinglash testi

656
00:40:03,723 --> 00:40:07,683
Erta turishimiz kerak bo'ladi-ku.

657
00:40:07,683 --> 00:40:13,150
Vneg (erta turmayman) ➔ kerak = V ni qilishi kerak
Erta turish = erta turish

658
00:40:13,173 --> 00:40:15,606
Tinglash testi

659
00:40:15,606 --> 00:40:18,339
Shunday.

660
00:40:22,197 --> 00:40:26,230
Tinglash testi

661
00:40:26,230 --> 00:40:30,997
Lekin bozor muhitini tushunib oldik.

662
00:40:30,997 --> 00:40:37,510
Лекин + [gap] = ammo...
Atmosfera = atmosfera

663
00:40:37,534 --> 00:40:41,567
Tinglash testi

664
00:40:41,567 --> 00:40:46,347
Bu yerda rasmga tushamizmi?

665
00:40:46,347 --> 00:40:52,881
Vstem + ましょうか = V ni qilaylikmi?
Rasmga tushirmoq = rasmga tushirmoq

666
00:40:52,905 --> 00:40:55,379
Tinglash testi

667
00:40:55,379 --> 00:40:58,212
Ha. Iltimos.

668
00:40:58,212 --> 00:41:02,126
Iltimos = iltimos

669
00:41:02,150 --> 00:41:05,096
Tinglash testi

670
00:41:05,096 --> 00:41:08,529
Yaxshi rasm chiqdi.

671
00:41:08,529 --> 00:41:13,262
Vpotential (tushirish mumkin) = tushirish mumkin / qila oladi
Yaxshi (yaxshi) ↔ Yomon (yomon)

672
00:41:13,285 --> 00:41:15,825
Tinglash testi

673
00:41:15,825 --> 00:41:18,743
Rahmat.

674
00:41:22,833 --> 00:41:24,333
5-SAHNA: Sovg'a uchun pichoq tanlash

675
00:41:24,333 --> 00:41:27,683
Tinglash testi

676
00:41:27,683 --> 00:41:31,616
Sovg'a olamiz.

677
00:41:31,616 --> 00:41:37,007
Vましょう = V ni qilaylik
Sovgʻa = sovgʻa

678
00:41:37,031 --> 00:41:39,599
Tinglash testi

679
00:41:39,599 --> 00:41:42,533
Nima buyurtma qilamiz?

680
00:41:42,533 --> 00:41:46,610
N + が + sifat = N yaxshi

681
00:41:46,634 --> 00:41:50,008
Tinglash testi

682
00:41:50,008 --> 00:41:53,956
Pichoq do'koni bor.

